<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Heinrich XI, Prince Reuss of Greiz</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1722–1800</span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Heinrich XI was a count of the Elder Line of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/house-of-reuss">House of Reuss</a> who reunited Upper and Lower <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greiz">Greiz</a> in 1768. In 1778 he was raised to the rank of prince of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-empire">Holy Roman Empire</a>, making Reuss-Greiz a principality. His descendants ruled it until 1918.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/heinrich-xi-prince-reuss-of-greiz.jpg" alt="Heinrich XI, Prince Reuss of Greiz" width="320" height="459" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unidentified painter · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Heinrich_XI._Reuss_Aelterer_Linie_(1722-1800).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
